[{:db/id "q-110812/selection/e8de5dff1739e2b530ef1148815eabea29710750e90b856a1fc19e6a586da20f" :answer/id #uuid "b5f62b49-9fc8-5168-b7a0-00e426579938" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{17}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110812/selection/9c6bfb4db8d042ca3b93589c844ac1c789909e0099f428d8083546a00b4d8cf7" :answer/id #uuid "775b0a1c-49e7-54c1-98c9-55b3271efc2c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110812/selection/f0318447e0cebaa9be25db91942014ae4300438bbaac7aea639d5d20bafe66e7" :answer/id #uuid "f3a2896b-ef95-5889-a713-d3d2df3cb765" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{11}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110812/selection/d027d90726f5bdbf1525aade1b6bde5c85e2082f2b792dfacee399fcc90e9833" :answer/id #uuid "713ee3ec-9773-5177-84a0-1e94c6397ff4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110812/selection/3b526d0871203a7fa20c2a891525c650a26e23eb2a93fea36737a1cf4d4423af" :answer/id #uuid "5f216c0c-b941-5832-a0e7-92a61fbba606" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{13}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110812/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "c30a9dd6-3716-546c-81eb-535d6aad3030" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-110812/selection/3b526d0871203a7fa20c2a891525c650a26e23eb2a93fea36737a1cf4d4423af" :answer-field/choices ["q-110812/selection/e8de5dff1739e2b530ef1148815eabea29710750e90b856a1fc19e6a586da20f" "q-110812/selection/9c6bfb4db8d042ca3b93589c844ac1c789909e0099f428d8083546a00b4d8cf7" "q-110812/selection/f0318447e0cebaa9be25db91942014ae4300438bbaac7aea639d5d20bafe66e7" "q-110812/selection/d027d90726f5bdbf1525aade1b6bde5c85e2082f2b792dfacee399fcc90e9833" "q-110812/selection/3b526d0871203a7fa20c2a891525c650a26e23eb2a93fea36737a1cf4d4423af"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-110812" :question/id #uuid "ded38983-0bd5-5a76-ae63-e605486f6707" :question/math-academy-id "q-110812" :question/problem "|  | $Y=0$ | $Y=1$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=1$ | $a$ | $2a$ |\n| $X=2$ | $\\frac{a}{2}$ | $5a$ |\n| $X=3$ | $3a$ | $\\frac{3a}{2}$ |\n\nThe joint probability mass function $f(x,y)$ for the discrete random variables $X$ and $Y$ is given above. Find the value of $a.$" :question/worked-solution "The support of $X$ is ${S}_{X}={1,2,3},$ the support of $Y$ is ${S}_{Y}={0,1},$ and therefore the joint support $S$ is\n\n$$\nS={S}_{X}\\times {S}_{Y}={(1,0),(1,1),(2,0),(2,1),(3,0),(3,1)}.\n$$\n\nSince we're given a joint probability distribution $f(x,y),$ we must have \n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{(x,y)\\in S}f(x,y)=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(1,0)+f(1,1)+f(2,0)+f(2,1)+f(3,0)+f(3,1) & =1 \\\\ a+2a+\\frac{a}{2}+5a+3a+\\frac{3a}{2} & =1 \\\\ 13a & =1 \\\\ a & =\\frac{1}{13}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-110812/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "38398622-ca45-5eb6-a589-96aec162960a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-110812"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-143866/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" :answer/id #uuid "16d318d0-93e5-576e-aabb-cd16fd8c009d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-143866/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "8edeb96c-6031-5df4-abb1-3df449e4374b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-143866/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "080a80b6-6235-5e9b-8ef7-b36c7417d479" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-143866/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "7fc8d990-6f09-535c-9699-3fa60dc7c30f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-143866/selection/1e5815fe88f764dcffb6e1d4884bd91ce2c23cb2e4c57c2f2f99b70378aa1f23" :answer/id #uuid "7e04ab26-496a-51b4-8b38-716698e51199" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I, II, and III" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-143866/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "90a7c3a1-ec01-53e6-9562-eb7077525232" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-143866/selection/1e5815fe88f764dcffb6e1d4884bd91ce2c23cb2e4c57c2f2f99b70378aa1f23" :answer-field/choices ["q-143866/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" "q-143866/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" "q-143866/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" "q-143866/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" "q-143866/selection/1e5815fe88f764dcffb6e1d4884bd91ce2c23cb2e4c57c2f2f99b70378aa1f23"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-143866" :question/id #uuid "265e1000-0088-5050-9691-488b4c209467" :question/math-academy-id "q-143866" :question/problem "| $f$ | $Y=2$ | $Y=4$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=1$ | $0.42$ | $0.18$ |\n| $X=3$ | $0.33$ | $0.07$ |\n\nConsider the function $f(x,y)$ shown in the table above. Which of the following conditions is true?\n\n- $0\\le f(x,y)\\le 1$ for all $(x,y)$ in $S$\n- ${\\sum }_{(x,y)\\in S}f(x,y)=1$\n- $f(x,y)$ is a valid joint probability mass function" :question/worked-solution "Let's check the given conditions:\n\n- Condition I is true. Every value of $f(x,y)$ in the table satisfies $0\\le f(x,y)\\le 1.$\n\n- Condition II is true. Adding up all the values of $f(x,y)$ shown in the table, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{(x,y)\\in S}f(x,y) & =0.42+0.18+0.33+0.07=1\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Condition III is true. Because $f(x,y)$ satisfies conditions I and II, it is a valid probability mass function.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-143866/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "38398622-ca45-5eb6-a589-96aec162960a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-143866"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-110810/selection/09f9568b9032a258744b73b08553a45679ce3baf10e1847349ddb9cf78a3d261" :answer/id #uuid "d558d5c8-497c-55aa-85ad-c12a4cf46985" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{10}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110810/selection/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" :answer/id #uuid "29b9faf8-a51e-5c0a-992d-7ed79b25828d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110810/selection/d3a7133ef1a1f6526aaec763d522f5ae075d8386a4606de90dcb93094f1d21d6" :answer/id #uuid "8f728fd2-c777-5b49-93a0-4684a42b9d5d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110810/selection/8bb646af439794acfbd313a6a7eb86a2818f1f792118f7583677724bca2d9903" :answer/id #uuid "25bc259b-5e05-5d7e-a8d7-8d17c6a02251" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110810/selection/9e11fa4df3725c69efaf2fb0a82d90e47a4519d002f721e23606c3d6290fb02c" :answer/id #uuid "d474ae32-4fdb-5a6f-b437-16424e4e19d9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110810/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f1730f85-24bc-5b7f-b3ff-a4fcef368824" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-110810/selection/09f9568b9032a258744b73b08553a45679ce3baf10e1847349ddb9cf78a3d261" :answer-field/choices ["q-110810/selection/09f9568b9032a258744b73b08553a45679ce3baf10e1847349ddb9cf78a3d261" "q-110810/selection/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" "q-110810/selection/d3a7133ef1a1f6526aaec763d522f5ae075d8386a4606de90dcb93094f1d21d6" "q-110810/selection/8bb646af439794acfbd313a6a7eb86a2818f1f792118f7583677724bca2d9903" "q-110810/selection/9e11fa4df3725c69efaf2fb0a82d90e47a4519d002f721e23606c3d6290fb02c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-110810" :question/id #uuid "82fc220f-fc1d-5ac4-99ab-fda7a4300e19" :question/math-academy-id "q-110810" :question/problem "|  | $Y=1$ | $Y=2$ | $Y=3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=0$ | $a$ | $2a$ | $a$ |\n| $X=1$ | $3a$ | $a$ | $2a$ |\n\nThe joint probability mass function $f(x,y)$ for the discrete random variables $X$ and $Y$ is given above. Find the value of $a.$" :question/worked-solution "The support of $X$ is ${S}_{X}={0,1},$ the support of $Y$ is ${S}_{Y}={1,2,3},$ and therefore the joint support $S$ is\n\n$$\nS={S}_{X}\\times {S}_{Y}={(0,1),(0,2),(0,3),(1,1),(1,2),(1,3)}.\n$$\n\nSince we're given a joint probability distribution $f(x,y),$ we must have \n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{(x,y)\\in S}f(x,y)=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(0,1)+f(0,2)+f(0,3)+f(1,1)+f(1,2)+f(1,3) & =1 \\\\ a+2a+a+3a+a+2a & =1 \\\\ 10a & =1 \\\\ a & =\\frac{1}{10}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-110810/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "38398622-ca45-5eb6-a589-96aec162960a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-110810"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-109335"] :question/problem "|  | $Y=2$ | $Y=4$ | $Y=6$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=1$ | $0.1$ | $0.25$ | $0.25$ |\n| $X=2$ | $0.05$ | $0.15$ | $0.2$ |\n\nCompute $P((X,Y)\\in {(1,4),(1,6),(2,6)})$ given that the random variables $X$ and $Y$ have the joint probability mass function $f(x,y)$ shown in the table above." :question/worked-solution "Using the values in the table, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P((X,Y)\\in {(1,4),(1,6),(2,6)}) & =P((X,Y)=(1,4)) \\\\  & +P((X,Y)=(1,6)) \\\\  & +P((X,Y)=(2,6)) \\\\  & =f(1,4)+f(1,6)+f(2,6) \\\\  & =0.25+0.25+0.2 \\\\  & =0.7.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-110937/selection/5d227958e8e2ab9feb7a492bded665cf59dfa9121f7d82334971c99adf799e26" :answer/id #uuid "a3d895e5-7b56-57f8-9f07-e0964b9422ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.25" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110937/selection/a44ed9268297050614edc4097a04d3089044bc70b376ad604b0445193a602b0a" :answer/id #uuid "875ee62d-cbb7-59eb-a0b0-af8c6703476e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.65" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110937/selection/625896633137e0044aec1ec040d8233380e151c0f7ffbedd051e7544cbdce1c4" :answer/id #uuid "fabea09b-5b67-50ea-a7c6-f5c1c62ec9fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.15" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110937/selection/2468d3f08d897d95f4d28b48c13e6034ce1716985d166fd89a0b8119476fe5c8" :answer/id #uuid "1f4034b3-8c53-5b10-95bb-6a05bb69013f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110937/selection/57f1df4deeb63ac8b169c1392105cc1ec886c4a882da47e1d3a4a61ab32f1e2a" :answer/id #uuid "2ac3d670-a6a0-5dc3-92fe-8070fe64c345" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110937/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "74f91859-7d27-5218-b8fc-6b2095e7dd3d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-110937/selection/2468d3f08d897d95f4d28b48c13e6034ce1716985d166fd89a0b8119476fe5c8" :answer-field/choices ["q-110937/selection/5d227958e8e2ab9feb7a492bded665cf59dfa9121f7d82334971c99adf799e26" "q-110937/selection/a44ed9268297050614edc4097a04d3089044bc70b376ad604b0445193a602b0a" "q-110937/selection/625896633137e0044aec1ec040d8233380e151c0f7ffbedd051e7544cbdce1c4" "q-110937/selection/2468d3f08d897d95f4d28b48c13e6034ce1716985d166fd89a0b8119476fe5c8" "q-110937/selection/57f1df4deeb63ac8b169c1392105cc1ec886c4a882da47e1d3a4a61ab32f1e2a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-110937" :question/id #uuid "3cbcd00b-ce5a-5af3-8959-83afbf1337f9" :question/math-academy-id "q-110937" :question/problem "|  | $Y=1$ | $Y=2$ | $Y=3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=1$ | $0.35$ | $0.15$ | $0.05$ |\n| $X=2$ | $0.1$ | $0.05$ | $0.1$ |\n| $X=3$ | $0.05$ | $0.05$ | $0.1$ |\n\nCompute $P((X,Y)\\in {(3,1),(3,2),(3,3)})$ given that the random variables $X$ and $Y$ have the joint probability mass function $f(x,y)$ shown in the table above." :question/worked-solution "Using the values in the table, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P((X,Y)\\in {(3,1),(3,2),(3,3)}) & =P((X,Y)=(3,1)) \\\\  & +P((X,Y)=(3,2)) \\\\  & +P((X,Y)=(3,3)) \\\\  & =f(3,1)+f(3,2)+f(3,3) \\\\  & =0.05+0.05+0.1 \\\\  & =0.2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-110937/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c0e20c64-85be-5cb5-acde-17ffd8b6aff5"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-110937"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-110964/selection/95a1d5fa369c4d08bda10228102d0fbae8f93732afc4c2ec3773c4f3d47df28c" :answer/id #uuid "0395db7b-7417-555b-9136-808527ad5bea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110964/selection/57f1df4deeb63ac8b169c1392105cc1ec886c4a882da47e1d3a4a61ab32f1e2a" :answer/id #uuid "5542f28b-0bce-5162-90a8-4f58d79a60fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110964/selection/549505ec1eff45d5707f9ce79cef58176927e720b974ae5802b0c0c0c252c752" :answer/id #uuid "4176ad44-f6c2-5141-8a71-e4c974365400" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.14" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110964/selection/909930bebd047